{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598410/extras/9ed8ebc14b3e15feb21559602c839163.avif?t=1748531247\" width=320 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Adder is a 2D, rogue-lite, zombie shooting, platformer sandbox.  Adder challenges players to manage random weapons, ammo, and abilities while fighting through hordes of zombies on procedurally generated levels. The map resets once the player dies, bringing a new experience with randomized elements to each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Procedurally Generated Levels:</i> Every death brings a new map and a novel set of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Randomized Gameplay:</i> Navigate through levels with randomized weapons, ammo, and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unyielding Zombie Hordes:</i> Employ strategic thinking to survive against relentless zombie waves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598410/extras/a84d465daa89b93486a8ccbd27766042.poster.avif?t=1748531247\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598410/extras/a84d465daa89b93486a8ccbd27766042.webm?t=1748531247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598410/extras/a84d465daa89b93486a8ccbd27766042.mp4?t=1748531247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deeper into the gameplay with the developer console (toggle with the tilde key `).</p>","background":"https://store.